  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4cc07f10dd0812aee23d6d40d5668d01d0218faf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"160\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>這是「亞歷克斯洞穴」的擴充模組，新增了多款獨具功能與用途的全新物品！</strong></p><p><strong><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/790ca90f0fec449081f27844f488cc8c925b655e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"226\"></strong></p><p><strong>方鉛控制器是極為稀有的道具，能讓您施展磁力跳躍，大幅提升移動效率。</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa36700e204430150086f0ab9dfd461590198b48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"539\" height=\"227\"></p><p><strong>鐵黏液方塊與普通黏液方塊的差異在於其排斥特性——當玩家跳上該方塊時會觸發彈射效果，但請注意它無法吸收墜落傷害。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2f6283ef8e72dc7e6236281f596f2775cd410b0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"229\"><br></strong></p><p><strong>以放射性鈾礦鑄造的長劍，能造成無法自然癒合的創傷並使對手中毒。</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b76b640bd76101d972b8a16d3a062bba2a4a62e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"228\"><br></strong></p><p><strong>音樂唱片，推測由曾居住於現稱「劇毒洞穴」區域的居民所創作。</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae2e07ca3f36fb2ced5f0ae8d5c0f54c7428a2cc.png\" alt=\"\"><br></strong></p><p><strong>用於製作飄浮藥水的特殊材料。</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>歡迎造訪我的YouTube頻道探索更多Minecraft改模內容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@bluzers777?si=-o9YiVnmDCeaTY-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtube.com/@bluzers777?si=-o9YiVnmDCeaTY-0</a></strong></span></p>",
